==Usage==
===Standard Usage===
<pre>
{{Utattemita
|Title=test
|Image=Template doc.png
|Vocal=yes
|Nnd2=sm24141
|YT=1214af2
|Producers=yes<br /> yes<br /> yes<br /> yes<br /> yes<br /> yes
}}
</pre>
<br/>
'''Output'''
{{Utattemita
|Title=test
|Image=Template doc.png
|Vocal=yes
|NND=sm12345
|YT=ab12cd34
|Producers=yes<br /> yes<br /> yes<br /> yes<br /> yes<br /> yes
}}
<br/>
===With Date Parameter===
<pre>
{{Utattemita
|English=test
|Kanji=テスト
|Romaji=tesuto
|Date=November 20, 2024
|Image=Template doc.png
|Vocal=yes
|Nnd2=sm24141
|YT=1214af2
|Producers=yes<br /> yes<br /> yes<br /> yes<br /> yes<br /> yes
}}
</pre>
<br/>
'''Output'''
{{Utattemita
|English=test
|Kanji=テスト
